Hi -- this error -- the real issue is at the bottom -- looks like one of the places where new R changed the before of an is.na <http://is.na> function or similar -- I believe I fixed all these recently.  Are you using a recent install from GitHub (e.g. from the last few weeks?).  If not, reinstall from GitHub and retry.

Cheers,
Nick

